## Wait for Compute Nodes

Continue after the compute nodes boot and complete their install. A node has
booted when `systemd` has finished starting it, and reports `running`, or
`degraded` if a unit failed. To check one node, and to list its failed units:

```bash
ssh ${compute_prefix}1 systemctl is-system-running
ssh ${compute_prefix}1 systemctl --failed
```

A node that never answers has failed to provision; check its console.

